  dct:description "occupation of a further maritime state-owned area of ​​7,266.36 m², located in the locality ''Punta San Paolo- Lotto L-H'' in the municipality of Civitavecchia, for the purpose of maintaining and managing plants connected to waste management in the port area"@en,
